Package: jamoviassistant
Type: Package
Title: Chat with an LLM Assistant that Works in the Open jamovi Window
Version: 0.1.0
Author: jamovi-assistant contributors
Maintainer: jamovi-assistant contributors <noreply@example.org>
Description: The results panel of this analysis hosts a chat with the
    jamovi-assistant (the jamovi_agent server extension). The conversation is
    stored in a hidden option, so it is saved with the .omv file.
